### Guide §5.1 Spring Boot fundamentals. Open in VS Code with the REST Client extension and click
### "Send Request" above a request. The app must be running on :8080.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Configuration, profiles and @Value (200)
GET {{host}}/api/info

### The @Primary greeter and the @Qualifier("casual") one (200)
GET {{host}}/api/info/greetings?name=Ada

### Without the parameter the default "reader" is used (200)
GET {{host}}/api/info/greetings
